  "body": "Replaces #349 by @mkinney (their commits kept as authored) with main merged in - the fork refused maintainer pushes.\n\nResolution: `crates/ui/src/lib.rs` (module list: `path_lines` from #349 and `post_file` from main, keep both sides). Everything else auto-merged; `git diff origin/main --stat` shows only #349's own 12 files.\n\nTargeted gate (merged tree):\n- `cargo test -p camcraft-app --test warned_moves` - 2 passed\n- `cargo test -p camcraft-app --lib warned_moves` - 3 passed\n- `cargo test -p camcraft-ui --lib -- path_lines banner warned operations toolpath_lines post_file op_page` (CWD crates/ui) - 29 passed\n- `cargo clippy -p camcraft-app -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -- -D warnings` - clean\n\nChangelog: Warned toolpath moves are drawn in the gouge colour with a marker, and each warning line on the operation page centres the viewport on its move\n\nRefs #261\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
